OL,3,APolice to crack down on face coverings
OL,4,Aat protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have announced plans to crack
OL,7,Fdown on the use of masks and balaclavas
OL,8,Fat a planned protest in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,11,FConstabulary said it would use new
OL,12,Fpowers under the Crime and Policing Act
OL,13,Fto prevent people involved in protest
OL,14,Factivity from wearing face coverings
OL,15,Fthat conceal their identity.
OL,17,FThe measures will apply in parts of the
OL,18,Fcity from 10:00 BST on Saturday until
OL,19,FSunday morning, with anyone breaching
OL,20,Fthe restrictions potentially facing
OL,21,Farrest.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
