OL,3,APolice to crack down on face coverings
OL,4,Aat protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said the powers were aimed at
OL,7,Fpreventing violence, intimidation and
OL,8,Fdisorder following protests in the city
OL,9,Fover the past week.
